A local toolchain plugin that only adds a checked-in directory of each module that enables it as
a Kotlin source directory (a task action's argument below `${module.rootDir}`, which
krusty-toolchain does not run): a module whose only filled source directory is that one compiles
it as its sources alone, and a module with sources of its own as well compiles both, and the
toolchain then describes its main fragment to the compiler, its sources in the order it walks the
fragment's directories and then the plugin's.
--- task
:mixed:compileJvm
--- project.yaml
modules:
  - generated-only
  - mixed
  - tools/pregenerated
plugins:
  - ./tools/pregenerated
--- tools/pregenerated/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
--- tools/pregenerated/plugin.yaml
tasks:
  declare:
    action: !org.example.build.declareSources
      sourceDir: ${module.rootDir}/generated-src/kotlin
generated:
  sources:
    - language: kotlin
      directory: ${tasks.declare.action.sourceDir}
--- tools/pregenerated/src/declareSources.kt
package org.example.build

import org.jetbrains.amper.plugins.Output
import org.jetbrains.amper.plugins.TaskAction
import java.nio.file.Path
import kotlin.io.path.isDirectory

@TaskAction
fun declareSources(@Output sourceDir: Path) {
    check(sourceDir.isDirectory()) { "Missing pre-generated sources: $sourceDir" }
}
--- generated-only/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
layout: maven-like
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
plugins:
  pregenerated: enabled
--- generated-only/generated-src/kotlin/org/example/Model.kt
package org.example

class Model
--- generated-only/generated-src/kotlin/.generator-hash
0123
--- mixed/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
layout: maven-like
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - ../generated-only
plugins:
  pregenerated:
    enabled: true
--- mixed/src/main/kotlin/Use.kt
fun use() = org.example.Model()
--- mixed/generated-src/kotlin/Generated.kt
fun generated() = use()
--- no-toolchain-oracle
The toolchain compiles the plugin module and runs its task before compiling a module that enables
it; with the recording krusty the plugin module compiles to nothing, so the task's action is not
found and the toolchain fails. The ledger follows the arguments the toolchain passed for modules
of this shape in a project it built with the real krusty.
--- krusty-argv
-Xjdk-release=25
-jdk-home=<directory>/jdk
-classpath=<directory>/home/.m2/repository/org/jetbrains/kotlin/kotlin-stdlib/2.4.20/kotlin-stdlib-2.4.20.jar:<directory>/home/.m2/repository/org/jetbrains/annotations/13.0/annotations-13.0.jar
-no-stdlib
-module-name=generated-only
-Xkotlin-reference-version=2.4.20
-d
<directory>/project/build/artifacts/CompiledJvmArtifact/generated-onlyjvm/kotlin-output
<directory>/project/generated-only/generated-src/kotlin/org/example/Model.kt
----
-Xjdk-release=25
-jdk-home=<directory>/jdk
-classpath=<directory>/project/build/artifacts/CompiledJvmArtifact/generated-onlyjvm/kotlin-output:<directory>/home/.m2/repository/org/jetbrains/kotlin/kotlin-stdlib/2.4.20/kotlin-stdlib-2.4.20.jar:<directory>/home/.m2/repository/org/jetbrains/annotations/13.0/annotations-13.0.jar
-no-stdlib
-module-name=mixed
-Xmulti-platform
-Xfragments=main
-Xfragment-sources=main:<directory>/project/mixed/src/main/kotlin/Use.kt
-Xfragment-sources=main:<directory>/project/mixed/generated-src/kotlin/Generated.kt
-Xkotlin-reference-version=2.4.20
-d
<directory>/project/build/artifacts/CompiledJvmArtifact/mixedjvm/kotlin-output
<directory>/project/mixed/generated-src/kotlin/Generated.kt
<directory>/project/mixed/src/main/kotlin/Use.kt
